meta {
  name: Account Balances
  type: http
  seq: 4
}

get {
  url: {{snaptradeBaseUrl}}/accounts/{{snaptradeAccountId}}/balances?userId={{snaptradeUserId}}
  body: none
  auth: none
}

assert {
  res.status: eq 200
}

docs {
  Cash balances per currency for the account in `snaptradeAccountId`. Set that
  env var yourself; **List Accounts** lists the available ids.

  Not yet consumed by Achalara — our performance math derives value from trades
  and positions. It matters for reconciliation: a sleeve's computed value plus
  uninvested cash should tie back to the brokerage's own total, which is a good
  check on whether the trade history we ingested is complete.

  Shares the per-account rate-limit bucket with the positions call (10
  requests/minute per account on Personal keys), so reading both counts twice.
}
